#basePath P3_LampreyUpstream
#include "Header.leaf"

:: Start
@exposed
@cutscene

// Mark start of thread
$set global:currentThread = "P3_LampreyUpstream"


// Separates dialogue depending on if player chose upstream or downstream first
$if global:downstreamFirst == false
       {@Claire}
              Sea lamprey go upstream at the end of their lives!
              After spending about a year in the lake, the sea lampreys travel into the tributaries to reproduce!
              Then they die!

       {@You}
              That's a bit dramatic, don't you think?

       {@Claire}
              A bit, yes!
              That is all to say that any intervention that targets sea lamprey going upstream is targeting adults going to reproduce!
       $call GiveEvidenceChip("Evidence-Spawn-Upstream")
       {@Claire}
              These interventions can be traps or barriers!

       {@You}
              That's good to keep in mind. 

       {@Claire}
              Excellent!
              If you'd like any more information, I'm happy to share, but I know you can be busy!

       {@}
              There are many places to go...
       $set global:upstreamFirst = true
$elseif global:downstreamFirst == true

        {@Claire}
              Sea lamprey go upstream at the end of their lives!
              After spending about a year in the lake, the sea lampreys travel into the tributaries to reproduce!
              Then they die!

       {@You}
              That's a bit dramatic, don't you think?

       {@Claire}
              A bit, yes!
              That is all to say that any intervention that targets sea lamprey going upstream is targeting adults going to reproduce!
       $call GiveEvidenceChip("Evidence-Spawn-Upstream")
       {@Claire}
              These interventions can be traps or barriers!
       {@You}
              That's good to keep in mind. 

       {@Claire}
              Excellent!
              Well, my work here is done! Shall we go into town for a dessert?

       {@You}
              I can't, but maybe this weekend?

       {@Claire}
              We have a deal. 

       {@}
              She walks with you back to your car.
$endif
// TEMPORARY Go to end
$goto .End


:: End
@exposed
@tracked

// Mark end of thread
$set global:currentThread = "NONE"

// Go to Phase 2 Continue Hub
$goto P3_Hub.Continue